- Removed the old "team" names from the REST API. Requests no longer accept `team_id`, `team_name`, `team`, `teams`, `team_ids`, and similar fields, and responses no longer include them. Use `fleet_id`, `fleet_name`, `fleet`, `fleets`, `fleet_ids`, etc. This includes `team_id` and `team_name` as `order_key` values, the duplicate `team_id` and `team_name` columns in the host CSV export, and `team` as a target type (use `fleet`).
